---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Isabelle P. Ho, electrical engineering student interested in aerospace systems and research.">
<section class="page-hero" id="top"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / ENGINEERING & CURIOSITY</p><h1>A little about <em>me.</em></h1><p class="lead">I’m {profile.name}, an electrical engineering student interested in aerospace systems, research, power electronics, and the questions that connect them.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-spacing"><div class="shell about-grid"><div class="about-placeholder"><span>PORTRAIT / FIELD PHOTO PLACEHOLDER</span><span>ADD YOUR OWN PHOTO</span></div><div class="about-content"><p class="eyebrow">BACKGROUND</p><h2>Modeling is where I start. Understanding is the goal.</h2><p>My experience spans spacecraft power simulation, independent research in deep-space optical communications, and active battery cell-balancing work. I enjoy the process of moving from an engineering question to a model, then testing whether the model actually behaves the way I expect.</p><p>Outside the lab, photography gives me another way to pay attention to the details. This space is meant to grow alongside my projects, interests, and experience.</p><div class="about-facts"><div><span class="eyebrow">EDUCATION</span><strong>B.S. Electrical Engineering</strong><span>Expected May 2028</span></div><div><span class="eyebrow">INTERESTS</span><strong>Aerospace · Research · Power Systems</strong><span>Modeling, simulation & optical communications</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="skills-section section-spacing"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">TOOLS & METHODS</p><h2>Technical toolkit<span class="period">.</span></h2><div class="skill-grid"><div><h3>Modeling & simulation</h3><p>MATLAB, Simulink, Simscape Electrical, LTspice, Aerospace Toolbox</p></div><div><h3>Engineering domains</h3><p>Spacecraft power budgets, battery management, power electronics, optical communication systems</p></div><div><h3>Working methods</h3><p>Parametric analysis, debugging, verification, technical documentation, system-level tradeoffs</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-spacing" id="contact"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h2>Let's connect<span class="period">.</span></h2></div><div><p>I’m open to conversations about engineering, research, and opportunities to learn and contribute.</p><div class="contact-links">{profile.email ? <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Email ↗</a> : <span>Email link / add in src/data/site.ts</span>}{profile.linkedin ? <a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a> : <span>LinkedIn / add in src/data/site.ts</span>}{profile.github ? <a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a> : <span>GitHub / add in src/data/site.ts</span>}{profile.resume && <a href={profile.resume} download>Résumé ↓</a>}</div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
